definition:
Noun;
A person or animal that is being humorously nonsensical. Someone possessing [characteristics] that are unusual or [extraordinary].

Adjective;
A general term used to describe things that are uncommon, interesting, or frustrating.

Verb;
Doing something hillarious, [questionable], or genuinely awesome.

example:
Noun;
“What a Shucknut.”
“[That dog] is a Shucknut.”

Adj;
“[I can’t] believe this shucknut idea!”
“This shucknut car won’t start!”

